      "writtenOn": "2026-11-02T18:23:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. Replaced the four ld4w loads in SSIMWINDOW_SVE with contiguous ld1w (#0..#3, mul vl) + vertical adds across row0, row0_next, row1, and row1_next before permuting only z0..z3 with uzp1/uzp2. On BenchmarkSsim_Opt (1280x720, 1000 iterations), this improves performance vs Patch Set 1 by +15.2% on Lumex C2-Ultra (SME2, 256 ms -\u003e 217 ms), +11.6% on Oryon V3-L (SME2, 147 ms -\u003e 130 ms), +9.9% on Apple M6 (SME2, 151 ms -\u003e 136 ms), and +2.3% on Cortex-A510 (SVE2, 1551 ms -\u003e 1516 ms; 1.12x vs pre-CL 1695 ms).",
